{"quest_id": 4584, "name": "時空のゲート", "description": "時の魔女ココロの依頼で急ぎデーモンを\n倒しに向かった王子達。\n急がねば大事に至るというが……。\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "時をかける魔女", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920067, "map_no": 3693, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 30000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 30000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 70, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 48, "attack_interval": 162, "move_speed": 150.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2105984, "race_id": 3, "special_effect_id": 82, "missile_id": 14, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 147}, "master_id": 774, "global_id": 773, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 23, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 3}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 142, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098272, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 82, "global_id": 81, "spawn_sec": 34}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 180, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 180, "damage_type": "magical", "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 80, "attack_interval": 231, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098032, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 69, "global_id": 68, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 70}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 100}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097360, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 16, "spawn_sec": 114}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ココロ", "text": "みなさん、急いで！\n早くしないと、\nデーモンが時空のゲートを開いちゃう！", "face": "u364"}, {"name": "ロイ", "text": "こ、これでも全力で走っているのですよ……。 \nしかし、デーモンが時空を超えるなどと、\n俄かに信じがたい話ですね……。", "face": "u11"}, {"name": "デーモン", "text": "グハハハ！\nついに、時空のゲートが開いたぞ！\n早速過去へ赴き、忌々しい王子を滅ぼしてやる。", "face": "l90b49cdb4253"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あれは、デーモン……！？\nしかし、顔が半分人間の様にも見えますが……。", "face": "l2323a32d9243"}, {"name": "デーモン", "text": "いかにも。\n我は時空を操る力を持つ魔術師を、\n我が身に取り込んだからな。", "face": "l90b49cdb4253"}, {"name": "デーモン", "text": "今の我はただのデーモンではない！\n時間を自由に行き来する……そうさな、\nクロノデーモンとでも名乗らせてもらおう。", "face": "l90b49cdb4253"}, {"name": "ロイ", "text": "クロノデーモン……！？\nつまり過去にも未来にも行ける存在ですか……。\n一体どういう原理でその様な事が――", "face": "u11"}, {"name": "ココロ", "text": "もうっ！　そんな事よりも、\nとにかく今はアイツを倒すの！\nじゃないと、歴史が――", "face": "u364"}, {"name": "クロノデーモン", "text": "――それでは王子、\n過去のお前を殺しに行くとしよう。\n我は100%勝てる戦いしかせぬのだ……フフフ。", "face": "l90b49cdb4253"}, {"name": "クロノデーモン", "text": "出でよ、魔の者らよ！\n奴らの相手をしておくのだ！", "face": "l90b49cdb4253"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、敵の全滅を確認しました。\n早く時空のゲートを超えて、\nクロノデーモンを追いましょう。", "face": "l2323a32d9243"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "過去の王子がデーモンと出会う事になれば、\n敗れるのは間違いないでしょうし。", "face": "l2323a32d9243"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "……。", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "ココロ", "text": "待って！　いそがなくても大丈夫。\nあの時空のゲートはいつ超えても、\n同じ時に繋がるんだよ。", "face": "u364"}, {"name": "ココロ", "text": "ちゃんと説明もせずに、\nここまで連れてきちゃったし、\n一度、クロノデーモンの事を話させて。", "face": "u364"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "分かりました。\nそれでは落ち着いて話せる場所に\nいったん移動しましょう。"}]}], "story_talk": true, "active": true}